{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5D6d96vJhMmVGMeDo1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered keyhole set in ancient oak.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through me from the other side. Cold. Carrying the scent of dust and something older than dust.*\n\n*I am locked.*\n\n*The brass plate around my keyhole is tarnished green with age. My grain is dark, deep, carved by centuries. I do not move. I do not yield. I have held this threshold longer than anyone remembers what I guard.*\n\n*Insert the key, or don't.*\n\n*I wait. I have always waited.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":133,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}